class.description:
One call takes a screenshot of the main window and saves it to [member ProjectSettings.display/screenshots/folder] with the file name pattern [member ProjectSettings.display/screenshots/file_name] in [member ProjectSettings.display/screenshots/format]. No screenshot is overwritten. [method capture_viewport] and [method capture_screen] return the [Image] without saving it, for example to show a preview first.
[codeblocks]
[gdscript]
func _unhandled_input(event):
    if event.is_action_pressed("screenshot"):
        var path = ScreenshotServer.take_screenshot()
        print("Saved ", path)
[/gdscript]
[csharp]
public override void _UnhandledInput(InputEvent @event)
{
    if (@event.IsActionPressed("screenshot"))
    {
        string path = ScreenshotServer.TakeScreenshot();
        GD.Print("Saved ", path);
    }
}
[/csharp]
[/codeblocks]
[b]Note:[/b] A viewport screenshot is the last rendered frame. The headless display server renders nothing, so there is no viewport screenshot in headless mode.
